			text = [=[The Valley of Strength lies just inside the great gate of {link:orgrimmar}Orgrimmar{/link}. It is the busiest place in the city. Here are the bank, the auction house and the tavern, and above them the tower where the wind riders land. Grunts watch every road. Travellers from every people of the {link:horde}Horde{/link} crowd its paths, and news from all {link:kalimdor}Kalimdor{/link} passes through it. It is here, too, that the Horde celebrates its victories. The heads of fallen enemies are raised above the valley, and the overlords of the city call on the people to honor the heroes who took them.]=],
