		},
		{
			title = "The Liberator",
			text = [=[In the wilds, Thrall found {link:grom-hellscream}Grom Hellscream{/link} and the last free clans. Among the {link:frostwolf-clan}Frostwolves{/link} in the {link:alterac-mountains}Alterac Mountains{/link}, the old shaman {link:drek-thar}Drek'Thar{/link} taught him to speak with the {link:elements}elements{/link}. Then he met {link:orgrim-doomhammer}Orgrim Doomhammer{/link}, and together they struck at the internment camps. Doomhammer fell in battle, and before he died he gave Thrall his hammer, his armor and his title. Thrall freed the orcs and broke the power of {link:aedelas-blackmoore}Blackmoore{/link} at {link:durnholde-keep}Durnholde{/link}.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "The Exodus",
			text = [=[A prophet came to Thrall in dreams and told him to lead his people west. He did. A storm cast his fleet upon the isles of the {link:darkspear-trolls}Darkspear{/link}, and he saved the trolls from their enemies. In {link:kalimdor}Kalimdor{/link} he won the friendship of {link:cairne-bloodhoof}Cairne Bloodhoof{/link} and the {link:tauren}tauren{/link}. He saw Grom fall again under the demon's blood, and freed him, and watched him die slaying {link:mannoroth}Mannoroth{/link}. At the {link:battle-of-mount-hyjal}Battle of Mount Hyjal{/link}, he fought beside humans and night elves against {link:archimonde}Archimonde{/link}. Afterward he founded {link:durotar}Durotar{/link} and {link:orgrimmar}Orgrimmar{/link}, and he made peace with {link:jaina-proudmoore}Jaina Proudmoore{/link} of {link:theramore-isle}Theramore{/link}.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Deeds",
			text = [=[• He freed the orcs from the internment camps.
