				{ type = "quest", id = 4941 },
			},
			text = [=[The news came from the {link:badlands}Badlands{/link}: Rend Blackhand, son of the old Warchief Blackhand, was alive and gathering the {link:blackrock-clan}Blackrock clan{/link} at {link:blackrock-mountain}Blackrock{/link} Spire. It had been thought that Rend was slain long ago. None in {link:orgrimmar}Orgrimmar{/link} knew the Blackrock as Eitrigg did, and none had a better claim to vengeance. He sent the news on to {link:thrall}Thrall{/link}.]=],
		},
		{
			key = "the-head-of-rend",
